// precLine(pick) — one pattern as its prompt line (about 30–60 tokens): what was done in how many of the agreements,
// by how many attorneys and counterparties (counts), its strength, and for a changed clause the wording to model a
// counter on. No names, no dates.

engine.precLine:
function precLine(x) {
